From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 23:18:46 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(delegation): optional subagent patience with an
 unresponsive provider

A background child waiting on a provider that queues the request behind
keepalive comments, or answers 429 engine_overloaded, keeps its activity
clock moving, so only the global stale breaker (5 windows) and the
auto-recovery ladder (5 cycles) end it: 15 minutes or more with nobody
watching. delegation.stream_stale_giveup and delegation.auto_recovery_cycles
set the child's own values. Unset, the child inherits as before.
